img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442960/extras/1f3163d7f370e9d5ef99261b36646279.avif?t=1773054073\" width=1200 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442960/extras/29ae26a7a21fee7287f3ce196c813581.avif?t=1773054073\" width=1200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unconventional apocalyptic sci-fi narrative</strong> and an amazing adventure that explores <strong>love, rebirth, and death</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 narrative sections</strong> <i>(Mainstory, Sidestory, Timestory)</i> with <strong>20 main endings </strong>and <strong>many fragmented stories</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The steps to unlock the stories are interlocked, and some are associated with <strong>real time</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our special <strong><i>Memory System</i></strong>, there are key nodes, character information, item information, and proper nouns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our large <strong><i>Collection System</i></strong>, there are beautiful CGs, original music, and 42 specially designed achievements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442960/extras/1f3163d7f370e9d5ef99261b36646279.avif?t=1773054073\" width=1200 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442960/extras/2e5134cc27cd6e5771d9d0ddfb6d5112.avif?t=1773054073\" width=1200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an unconventional,  apocalyptic sci-fi fairy tale about \u201cLove, Rebirth and Death\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to make choices, get clues, and solve puzzles as you are immersed in the stories, which will promote the development of the stories and help you know more about characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Remember, everyone is the protagonist of their own life.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>And the memories from different people may only demonstrate one side of the truth.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Don\u2019t make an overgeneralisation.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the stories will come to their own ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And we will meet again at the end of it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442960/extras/1f3163d7f370e9d5ef99261b36646279.avif?t=1773054073\" width=1200 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442960/extras/681131d51f76fc1b642dc2183c7dc771.avif?t=1773054073\" width=1200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>-\u6b64\u95f4\u68a6Sono-</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">E-mail</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><a href=\"mailto:sonodream@163.com\">sonodream@163.com</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sina Weibo / Bilibili / 